        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Drill-down Links",
      "description": "Action: use these drill-downs after the home verdict identifies the failing evidence chain. Healthy: IDLE WARM with all evidence green needs no drill-down.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**When to drill down:**\n- GPU pressure or OOM risk → [GPU Capacity and OOM Risk](/d/gpu_capacity_and_oom_risk/gpu-capacity-and-oom-risk)\n- Queue or KV pressure → [Model Runtime Deep Dive](/d/model_runtime_deep_dive/model-runtime-deep-dive)\n- Chat latency or streaming issue → [API Experience](/d/api_experience/api-experience)\n- Risk timeout or detector issue → [Risk Signal Operations](/d/risk_signal_operations/risk-signal-operations)\n- Scrape target or metric freshness issue → [Observability / Data Quality](/d/observability_data_quality/observability-data-quality)\n- Full runtime reviewer summary → [Executive Runtime Overview](/d/executive_runtime_overview/executive-runtime-overview)\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
